// Title: Indicator Removal on Host - Clear Mac System Logs
// Sigma ID: acf61bd8-d814-4272-81f0-a7a269aa69aa
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: remotephone, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-11 | Modified: 2022-09-16
// ATT&CK: defense-impairment, T1685.006
// Description: Detects deletion of local audit logs
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate administration activities
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1070.002/T1070.002.md
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_clear_system_logs.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "/rm" or FolderPath endswith "/unlink" or FolderPath endswith "/shred") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "/var/log" or (ProcessCommandLine contains "/Users/" and ProcessCommandLine contains "/Library/Logs/"))
